
### Application Notes API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5005
@employerId = 1
@applicationId = 1
@noteId = 1

### 1. Add a note
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/application-notes/{{applicationId}}
X-User-Id: {{employerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Candidate has strong Java and Spring Boot experience."
}

### 2. Add another note
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/application-notes/{{applicationId}}
X-User-Id: {{employerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Schedule a technical interview next week."
}

### 3. Get all notes for application
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/application-notes/{{applicationId}}
X-User-Id: {{employerId}}

### 4. Delete a note
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/application-notes/{{applicationId}}/{{noteId}}
X-User-Id: {{employerId}}
